        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 263,
        "headingId": 764,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Cutaneous epithelioid angiomatous nodule is a distinctive benign cutaneous vascular proliferation with prominent epithelioid cell morphology.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T12:10:58"
      }
    ],
